# Laid out Medium on an opened fold's inner screen upright (MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2), a finger: the page's
# own stack on the tape (sfdesk frame.mbt: what is opened from the page goes over it). 文件 from the rail, its folder's
# page brought over, a folder in it opened (over it, sliding in); swiped back and called off (the folder with the
# finger, then back), swiped back and gone through (the folder it was opened from), swiped back again (the sidebar).
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap icon:folder
wait 1200
tapxy -24 420
wait 900
tap 设计稿
wait 1200
backswipe 240 700 off
wait 800
backswipe 300 700
wait 1000
backswipe 300 700
wait 1000
exit
